# ✅ **2. Create a New Node**

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

struct Node {
    int data;
    struct Node *left, *right;
};

struct Node* create(int item) {
    struct Node* newnode = (struct Node*)malloc(sizeof(struct Node));
    newnode->data = item;
    newnode->left = newnode->right = NULL;
    return newnode;
}
```

