# ✅ **3. Insert in a BST**  
(from page 17 fileciteturn0file0)

Simplest version:

```c
struct Node* insert(struct Node* root, int item) {
    if (root == NULL)
        return create(item);

    if (item < root->data)
        root->left = insert(root->left, item);
    else
        root->right = insert(root->right, item);

    return root;
}
```

