# ✅ **4. Inorder Traversal (Left, Root, Right)**  
(from page 18 fileciteturn0file0)

```c
void inorder(struct Node* root) {
    if (root == NULL)
        return;

    inorder(root->left);         // left
    printf("%d ", root->data);   // root
    inorder(root->right);        // right
}
```

