# ✅ **8. Find Minimum Node (Used in Deletion – Case 3)**  
(from page 23 fileciteturn0file0)

```c
struct Node* findMin(struct Node* root) {
    while (root->left != NULL)
        root = root->left;
    return root;
}
```

