# ✅ **10. Find Parent Node in BST**  
(from page 24 fileciteturn0file0)

Cleaned version:

```c
struct Node* findParent(struct Node* root, struct Node* ptr) {
    if (root == NULL || root == ptr)
        return NULL;

    if (root->left == ptr || root->right == ptr)
        return root;

    if (ptr->data < root->data)
        return findParent(root->left, ptr);
    else
        return findParent(root->right, ptr);
}
```

